@startuml SD_TerimaBarang
skinparam sequence {
  ActorBackgroundColor #EDE7F6
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #E8F5E9
  ArrowColor #6A1B9A
}

actor "Staff" as Staff
participant "Browser\n(Next.js)" as UI
participant "API /api/inventory\n/penerimaan" as API
participant "Auth" as Auth
database "Database\n(MySQL)" as DB
collections "S3 Storage" as S3

Staff -> UI : Buka menu Penerimaan Barang\nKlik "Tambah Penerimaan Baru"

UI -> API : GET /api/inventory\n(ambil daftar supplier & bahan baku)
API -> Auth : Verifikasi sesi
Auth --> API : Valid
API -> DB : SELECT suppliers, bahan_baku WHERE isActive = true
DB --> API : Data supplier & bahan baku
API --> UI : Response data

Staff -> UI : Isi form:\nsupplierId, nomorFaktur, tanggal\nitem[{bahanBakuId, jumlah, hargaBeli}]

alt Ada bukti nota yang diunggah
  UI -> S3 : Upload file nota / faktur
  S3 --> UI : URL file berhasil
end

Staff -> UI : Klik Submit
UI -> API : POST /api/inventory/penerimaan\n{supplierId, items[], totalTagihan, buktiNota?}
activate API

API -> Auth : Verifikasi sesi
Auth --> API : Valid (userId)

API -> DB : BEGIN TRANSACTION

API -> DB : INSERT penerimaan_barang\n{supplierId, addedById, totalTagihan, buktiNota}
DB --> API : penerimaan.id

loop Untuk setiap item bahan baku yang diterima
  API -> DB : INSERT stok_masuk\n{penerimaanId, bahanBakuId, jumlah, hargaBeli}
  DB --> API : stok_masuk tersimpan

  API -> DB : UPDATE bahan_baku\nSET stok = stok + jumlah\nWHERE id = bahanBakuId
  DB --> API : stok diperbarui
end

note right of API
  Pencatatan Double-Entry:
  Debet  = Persediaan Bahan Baku
  Kredit = Hutang Dagang / Kas
end note

API -> DB : INSERT jurnal_umum (sisi Debet)\n{akunDebetId = Persediaan, nominal, penerimaanId}
DB --> API : jurnal Debet tersimpan

API -> DB : INSERT jurnal_umum (sisi Kredit)\n{akunKreditId = Hutang/Kas, nominal, penerimaanId}
DB --> API : jurnal Kredit tersimpan

API -> DB : COMMIT TRANSACTION
DB --> API : OK
deactivate API

API --> UI : 201 Created + data penerimaan
UI --> Staff : Toast "Penerimaan berhasil dicatat"\nRefresh daftar penerimaan & saldo stok

@enduml
